## scope

This covers dormouse's OWN crates (dormouse-kda, dormouse-gdn2, dormouse-rope, dormouse-mor,
...), which are original work published here under MIT — see
`docs/adr/0017-dormouse-fused.md` for why they live in this directory instead of
being burn-rs dependencies. It does NOT cover upstream burn-rs code vendored
elsewhere in the tree (`vendor/cubecl-fix`, `vendor/cubek-fix`), which keeps its
own upstream notices and terms.
